00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.800
Sorry, Mom, I'm calling Colin.

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:37.950
- [Colin] Oh, you got a lot of
tidying up to do here, Furze.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:40.020
You got a lot of tidying up.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:41.520
- All right, well, thanks for the call.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:44.720
And by the way, thanks for being a lawyer

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:47.330
